# Day 8/60 — Building an Environmental Health Dashboard with Claude

## Objective

Learn how Claude can be used as an application builder instead of only a conversational assistant.

## Task

Use the provided Environmental Health Analyzer prompt and allow Claude to generate a complete dashboard application.

## Process

1. Open Claude
2. Paste the Environmental Health Analyzer prompt
3. Generate the application
4. Test functionality
5. Deploy and review the final output

## Final Output

Live Demo:

https://ecopluseai.netlify.app/

## Features

* Interactive dashboard
* Environmental data visualization
* Filters and controls
* Downloadable HTML application
* User-friendly interface

## Key Learnings

### 1. Prompts Can Act as Specifications

A well-structured prompt can provide enough information for AI to generate an entire application.

### 2. AI Accelerates Prototyping

Instead of spending hours creating a prototype manually, Claude can generate a working foundation within minutes.

### 3. AI Is More Than A Chatbot

Claude can assist with:

* Planning
* Coding
* UI generation
* Documentation
* Prototyping

## Biggest Insight

The real value of AI is not just getting answers.

It is reducing the gap between an idea and a working product.

